    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Pedro Land DX is a compilation of several little adventures, starring a man named Pedro Sombrero.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTaco Tower marks Pedro Sombrero's start as a hero. His goal is to reclaim the ancient spire of his ancestors from the rabid monsters that roam his homeland, Doon.<br />\r\nPedro Land continues Pedro's quest to stop the monster invasions at their source in Death City, one of Doon's ancient landmarks.<br />\r\nSpicy Salsa contains a few harder levels. Pedro must take on a mysterious person who has stolen colors from Pedro's home!<br />\r\nPedro Land 2 sees Pedro going on a great treasure hunt, full of great dangers and exotic locales!<br />\r\nPedro Land 3 tells a story of a war against an invading army from the East!<br />\r\nWicked Tower contains every boss encountered in the previous modes. Do you have what it takes?<br />\r\nGunman Castle is the final chapter, with Pedro investigating the fortress and uncovering its mysteries.<br />\r\nPedro Land, Pedro Land 2, and Pedro Land 3 also contain secret boss rushes!<br />\r\nPedro Land DX involves run-and-gun action platforming like beloved games of the late 80s to early 90s, with a western feel!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso comes with a free manual!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\nW - up/interact with NPCs, doors, etc<br />\r\nA and D - left and right, respectively<br />\r\nS - duck/down<br />\r\nL/Spacebar - jump<br />\r\nK/left click on mouse - shoot<br />\r\nEnter - initiate game mode, exit NPC dialogue, etc<br />\r\nEscape key - pause/unpause game",
    "about_the_game": "Pedro Land DX is a compilation of several little adventures, starring a man named Pedro Sombrero.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTaco Tower marks Pedro Sombrero's start as a hero. His goal is to reclaim the ancient spire of his ancestors from the rabid monsters that roam his homeland, Doon.<br />\r\nPedro Land continues Pedro's quest to stop the monster invasions at their source in Death City, one of Doon's ancient landmarks.<br />\r\nSpicy Salsa contains a few harder levels. Pedro must take on a mysterious person who has stolen colors from Pedro's home!<br />\r\nPedro Land 2 sees Pedro going on a great treasure hunt, full of great dangers and exotic locales!<br />\r\nPedro Land 3 tells a story of a war against an invading army from the East!<br />\r\nWicked Tower contains every boss encountered in the previous modes. Do you have what it takes?<br />\r\nGunman Castle is the final chapter, with Pedro investigating the fortress and uncovering its mysteries.<br />\r\nPedro Land, Pedro Land 2, and Pedro Land 3 also contain secret boss rushes!<br />\r\nPedro Land DX involves run-and-gun action platforming like beloved games of the late 80s to early 90s, with a western feel!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso comes with a free manual!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\nW - up/interact with NPCs, doors, etc<br />\r\nA and D - left and right, respectively<br />\r\nS - duck/down<br />\r\nL/Spacebar - jump<br />\r\nK/left click on mouse - shoot<br />\r\nEnter - initiate game mode, exit NPC dialogue, etc<br />\r\nEscape key - pause/unpause game",
    "short_description": "An intense, retro run-and-gun platformer western game!",
